<title>USA: Avatar names Gerald Kelfer president.</title>
<headline>Avatar names Gerald Kelfer president.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avatar Holdings Inc said on Tuesday that it has named vice chairman Gerald Kelfer to the additional title of president.</p>
<p>Edwin Jacobson, who was previously president, will continue as chief executive officer and chairman of the executive committee, the real estate company said.</p>
</text>
